OL,3,ARussian hybrid attacks against Europe
OL,4,Aintensifying, says Macron
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,7,Fwarned that the threat of hybrid
OL,8,Fattacks by Russia against Europe and
OL,9,FFrance has intensified.
OL,11,FIn a news conference at the Elysee
OL,12,FPalace, Macron said he had ordered a
OL,13,Fplan to protect critical infrastructure
OL,14,Fand defence industry sites in the face
OL,15,Fof this threat.
OL,17,FHe said France had been targeted by
OL,18,FRussian hybrid attacks in the past few
OL,19,Fweeks which would not be left "without
OL,20,Fa response".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
